# MadrassaPlay V2 — Deferred items only (not in current release)

This file lists good ideas we will NOT implement now, reserved for the next version.

## Admin (Templates)
- Deprecate lifecycle state for templates (hide from new creations but keep existing playable).
- Preflight validation UI on template upload (manifest/schema/engine entry checks before sending to server).
- Default settings UI (edit `defaultConfigOverrides` per template) to pre-fill Create form values.
- Template icon file upload control in Template Meta (call `/:id/media?usage=icon` from the UI).
- Per-template storage dashboard: creations count, results count, total storage under `/uploads/templates/<templateId>`.
- "Clean Draft Uploads" action to remove `/creations/draft` files older than X days.
- Asset policy UI: configure allowed MIME types per template and optional max image size hint (server remains authoritative).
- Audit log of admin actions (upload, publish, delete, deprecate, meta changes).
- Role-based restrictions per template (e.g., some templates admin-only).

## Badges (Template Awards)
- Show usage stats: number of users awarded, per-tier distribution.
- Quick presets and reordering UX refinements beyond threshold auto-sort.

## Engines & Storage
- Engine versioning/migration guidance: display engineVersion in admin and warn when creations use older engine versions.
- Per-template `assets.allowedMimeTypes` (UI + enforcement on upload routes).
- Storage quotas and warnings per template or globally (soft limits with admin override).

## Maintenance & Ops
- Background job to purge orphaned uploads not referenced by any creation.
- Health page to validate static routes (/engines, /uploads, /badge-icons) and write permissions.

## Teacher — My Games
- Manage actions: rename and duplicate creations (with server endpoints), bulk delete.
- Better discovery: search, sort (newest/oldest/name), pagination or infinite scroll.
- Quick analytics chips: attempts count and avg percent (lazy-loaded summaries).
- Per-template caps: show “N/M creations” and “images used/max” overlays.
- Card badges: deprecated template, missing engine, policy (first-only/all) indicators.

## Teacher — Assignments
- Recurrence and advanced scheduling (windows, late policy).
- Inline “Assign this” from game cards with preset selection sheets.
- Assignment detail page: class-level progress, per-game completion tiles.
- Bulk operations: close, duplicate, extend dates.

## Teacher — Reporting
- Filters (date/student/class), CSV export, and print-friendly views.
- Attempt history drill-down and trend charts (per class and per student).
- Cross-assignment comparisons for a creation or template.

## Teacher — My Classes
- Attendance/presence integration and per-session rollup.
- Per-student profile: recent assignments, badges, progress sparkline.
- Messaging shortcuts (announce to class, DM student/guardian).

## Teacher — Live Sessions
- Full student join UX (code + name), lobby roster, and moderation (kick/mute).
- Host controls: pause, end, timer, reveal answers, show leaderboard.
- Post-session summary (attempts, top performers) with export.
- Socket auth/room security (JWT handshake), reconnect/resume flows.

## Teacher — Timetable
- Real data wiring for teacher classes; inline edit schedule.
- Conflict detection and suggestions; calendar sync (ICS export).

## Student — Join Game UI
- Dedicated “Join” screen with room code and display name; error states and retry.
- Persist last used name; join history list.
